.TH DCHESS 6 "2026-09-28" "dchess @VERSION@" "Games"
.SH NAME
dchess \- chess in your terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dchess
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B dchess \-\-uci
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dchess
is a chess program for the terminal, with its own engine.
Play against it at three levels or against any UCI engine, play a friend,
or watch two engines play each other.
It keeps profiles with their game history and statistics, replays and
reviews games, analyses positions, and has about 3200 built-in puzzles.
.PP
Started with no options it opens a launcher: profiles, a new-game setup
and your recent games.
Started through pipes with no arguments, as chess GUIs start engines, it
speaks UCI.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-color " \fIwhite\fR|\fIblack\fR"
The side you play (default white).
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-difficulty " \fIeasy\fR|\fImedium\fR|\fIhard\fR"
The engine's strength: easy searches to depth 2 in up to 1.5 s, medium to
depth 5 in up to 3 s (the default), hard as deep as it gets in 5 s.
.TP
.BR \-2 ", " \-\-two\-player
Two people at one keyboard, no engine; the board turns after each move.
.TP
.BR \-\-white " \fIwho\fR, " \-\-black " \fIwho\fR"
Who plays a side: a profile name,
.BR guest ,
.BR human ,
a level
.RB ( easy ", " medium ", " hard ),
or the name of a registered engine.
Overrides
.BR \-c ", " \-d " and " \-2 .
.TP
.BR \-\-profile " \fIname\fR"
Play as this profile for this run.
.TP
.B \-\-profiles
List the profiles with their records and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-uci
Run as a UCI engine on standard input and output.
.TP
.BR \-\-clock " \fIM\fR+\fIS\fR"
A time control: minutes plus seconds of increment, e.g.
.BR 5+3 ,
.BR 0.5+0 ,
or
.B 5+0/1+0
for White/Black time odds.
.TP
.BR \-\-replay " \fIfile.pgn\fR"
Step through the games in a PGN file, choosing one when there are several.
.TP
.BR \-\-book " \fIbuiltin\fR|\fIoff\fR|\fIpath.bin\fR"
The opening book for dchess's engine for this run: the built-in one, none,
or a Polyglot book.
.TP
.B \-\-engines
List the registered UCI engines and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-fen " \fIFEN\fR"
Start from this position.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-menu
Show the launcher even when other options were given.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-menu
Skip the launcher and start at once.
.TP
.BR \-\-theme " \fIname\fR"
The colour theme:
.BR gruvbox " (default), " tokyonight ", " btop " or " catppuccin .
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-stats
Show the statistics page and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-puzzles
Solve puzzles: rated, by theme, a three-minute rush, or the ones you
missed.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the options and exit.
.SH KEYS
.SS Game
.TP
.BR h " " j " " k " " l ", arrows"
Move the cursor.
.TP
.B Enter
Pick up a piece, then play it to the cursor.
A pawn reaching the last rank asks for the piece:
.BR q " " r " " b " " n ,
Enter for a queen, Esc to take the move back.
.TP
.B Esc
Put the piece back.
.TP
.B i
Type a move
.RB ( e2e4 )
or a command
.RB ( go ", " stop ", " new ", " undo ", " flip ", " swap ", " pgn ", " fen ", " help ,
and more).
.TP
.B a
Analysis on or off.
.TP
.B u
Take back a move.
.TP
.B Space
Pause or resume; in a timed game this freezes both clocks.
.TP
.B Tab
A statistics popup.
.SS Launcher
.TP
.BR "\(ua \(da \(<- \(->"
Move between rows, change a value.
.TP
.B Tab
Profiles, the new game, your card.
.TP
.BR n " " r " " d
New, rename, delete a profile.
.TP
.B Enter
Start, or replay the game selected on your card.
.TP
.BR z " " e " " s " " Esc
Puzzles, engines, statistics, quit.
.SS Puzzles
.TP
.BR Enter ", " i
Play a move by cursor, or type it
.RB ( Nf3 " or " g1f3 ).
.TP
.BR ? " " s
A hint, or the solution; either counts as a miss.
.TP
.BR n " " r " " Esc
The next puzzle, this one again, back to the menu.
.SS Replay
.TP
.BR "\(<- \(->" ", Home, End"
Step, or jump to the start or the end.
.TP
.B Space
Play the moves one a second.
.TP
.BR a " " r " " n " " N
Analysis, review every move, the next or previous marked move.
.TP
.B p
Play on from this position.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dchess/profiles.conf
Profiles and their remembered setup.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dchess/engines.conf
Registered UCI engines.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dchess/games.pgn
Every finished game, as PGN.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dchess/puzzles/\fIprofile\fP.txt
A profile's puzzle rating, streaks, and seen and missed puzzles.
.PP
The two configuration files follow
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
when it is set.
.SH UCI
.B dchess \-\-uci
understands
.BR uci ", " isready ", " ucinewgame ", " position ", " go
(with
.BR wtime ", " btime ", " winc ", " binc ", " movetime ", " depth ", " infinite ),
.BR stop " and " quit ,
reports
.B info
lines as it searches, and has one option,
.BR OwnBook .
.SH SEE ALSO
The guide and the project journal:
.I https://github.com/DDumbying/dchess
.SH AUTHOR
The dchess project,
.IR https://github.com/DDumbying/dchess .
